OL,3,GNEWSAEvacuations after restaurant crash
OL,4,Acauses gas leak
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people who had been in the
OL,7,Frestaurant at the time of the crash
OL,8,Fwere assessed for minor injuries,
OL,9,FMerseyside Fire and Rescue Service
OL,10,Fsaid.
